        d.put("terminal triggerbot/delay", "Cheat build only. How long your crosshair must stay on a terminal before it is opened, 0-1000 ms in 25 ms steps (default 0). Each click raises it; after the max it wraps back to 0.");
        d.put("terminal triggerbot/cooldown", "Cheat build only. Minimum gap between two terminal opens, 0-2000 ms in 50 ms steps (default 250). Each click raises it; after the max it wraps back to 0.");
        d.put("terminal triggerbot/range", "Cheat build only. How far away, in blocks, a terminal you look at can be opened from: 1.0-4.0 in 0.5 steps (default 4.0). Each click raises it; after 4.0 it wraps back to 1.0.");
        d.put("dungeon/termism", "Practice mode for F7/M7 terminals: opens fake terminals you can solve anywhere, with no solver highlights. /termism opens it too.");
        d.put("new/thorn (f4)", "Helpers for Thorn, the F4/M4 boss: a Spirit Bear kill counter, highlights for the spirit animals, Spirit Bear and Spirit Bow, and your own stun-spot waypoints. All off by default.");
        d.put("thorn (f4)/thorn highlights", "Coloured boxes or a glow on Thorn-fight targets during the F4/M4 boss. Only drawn for targets you can see right now.");
        d.put("trajectories/bows", "Draws the arrow path and landing spot while holding a bow. While drawing, it follows how far the bow is pulled back. Otherwise it shows a full-power shot, which is how shortbows like the Terminator fire. Off by default.");
